"We pick up from homes, hospitals, aged-care residences and day programs in "
"%s and take you anywhere across Melbourne and the Mornington Peninsula — "
"including Melbourne and Avalon airports."
msgstr ""
"نستقبلك من المنازل والمستشفيات ودور رعاية المسنين والبرامج النهارية في %s، "
